92186045453 13194139534880 true] [17592186317025 1111 #uuid "dc6b724a-35d2-5e47-b2fa-8ed3898fb26a" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317026 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317027 13194139534880 true] [17592186317026 1089 "q-100424" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317026 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534880 true] [17592186317026 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317026 1113 #uuid "6c5d67b1-17eb-5fed-900a-3f60a9deeff9" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317026 1145 "First, we substitute $u={x}^{2}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=x\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSince $u\\to \\infty $ when $x\\to \\infty ,$ the table for the limits of integration using the rule $u={x}^{2}$ is as follows:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\infty $ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\infty $ |\n\nSo, the integral in terms of the new variable $u$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-u}\\,\\text{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we proceed by setting the upper bound equal to some parameter $a,$ integrating as usual, and then taking the limit as $a\\to \\infty .$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{-u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[-{e}^{-u}]}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[{e}^{-u}]}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot ({lim}_{a\\to \\infty }\\frac{1}{{e}^{a}}-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, recall the end behavior of the function $y=\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}},$ shown in the graph below:\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}}=\\infty $\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}}=0$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14042659/assets/4844d6220d04a6a1fffdd5a485a9e6724aa6065397b8c3a009157a7a2dafc3cf.png)\n\nUsing this to evaluate our integral, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot ({lim}_{a\\to \\infty }\\frac{1}{{e}^{a}}-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (0-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317028 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317029 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317030 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317031 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317032 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1041 "selection" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317029 13194139534880 true] [17592186317027 1110 #uuid "28565e4b-6627-5b45-893a-e114d620b023" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317028 1034 "The integral diverges" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317028 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534880 true] [17592186317028 1111 #uuid "1331ccfd-5799-52f0-92c9-42437b8d9bdb" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317029 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317029 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534880 true] [17592186317029 1111 #uuid "0b108031-4124-57ec-9844-c213d2e4dc23" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317030 1034 "2" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317030 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534880 true] [17592186317030 1111 #uuid "c4952de8-1cd2-5da5-8769-56da18627c82" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317031 1034 "1" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317031 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534880 true] [17592186317031 1111 #uuid "7b73fad5-876c-55eb-88bf-4b847cd6e4ed" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317032 1034 "-2" 13194139534880 true] [17592186317032 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534880 true] [17592186317032 1111 #uuid "3114b948-3060-5b59-89f3-827cfe25